description	"Sith Inquisitor

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- RoF: 1.11x
- Lightsaber ^9(Staff/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (3)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- Damage: 260/^2130
^2-- Spec Damage: 1.25x
^2-- Length: 40
^1-- Radius: 1.7

^3Abilities:
- Saber Throw (3) ^3[Saber CS1]
- Quick Throw (3) ^3[CS3]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Sense (2)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (2)
- Healing (1)
- Tracking Beacon

A fast and adaptable hunter of Jedi, possessing specialty Force and Saber skills."